# S-844 T-964: Bare DotAccess in pattern position produces Pattern::Constructor with qualified tag.
# Color.Red: → Constructor { tag: "Color.Red", binding: None }
# Parser accepts this syntax. Runtime tag matching deferred (variant tags currently unqualified).
# The _ arm catches all values until the elaboration pass qualifies variant tags.
[match "x"
    Color.Red: "matched"
    _:         "other"]
=== out
String("other")
